<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#141519;">Link your account with {{ name }}</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">{{ name }} invited you to link your {{ brand }} account to theirs as your parent or guardian.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If you accept, {{ name }} can see the parts of your studies you choose to share, such as your subjects, practice results and goals. Your tutor conversations are never shared. You can change what you share, or remove the link, at any time.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Sign in with this email address, then accept:</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#c3e84f;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="{{ link }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#141519;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Review the invite</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#4b4e4a;font-size:14px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
<a href="{{ link }}" style="color:#141519;word-break:break-all;">{{ link }}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">The link works once and expires on {{ expires_at }}. If you do not know {{ name }}, ignore this email and nothing will change.</p>
